        "is_free": false,
        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >                                <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3947280/extras/a4c42de2f69cc1b39879b99dc67fb554.avif?t=1787021468\" width=348 height=116 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After surviving a brutal storm at sea, Simon Rhodes awakens on a mysterious island ruled by a sprawling hedge maze and its terrifying inhabitants. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blast your way through relentless enemies, conserve your limited bullets, and survive as long as you can in this retro-inspired top-down arcade challenge. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose between <i>Normal Play</i> for a gradual challenge or <i>Difficult Play</i> for instant chaos. Achieve your highest score across both modes! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features </strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Evade, shoot, or outmaneuver monsters in a top-down hedge maze. </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From invisible ghosts to relentless werewolves, each foe behaves uniquely. </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three grenades – A last-resort panic button to clear the screen when overwhelmed. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Four maze layouts to choose from.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two difficulty modes: </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Normal Play</i> – Easier start, progressive difficulty ramp.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Difficult Play</i> – Instant chaos. All enemies are  aggressive from the start. </p></li></ul></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Separate high score tables for each mode. </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by 2nd generation “Stalker/Cavern” games of the early 1980s. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no maps, no allies, and no way to fight forever. How long can you last before the hedge consumes you? </p>",
        "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >                                <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3947280/extras/a4c42de2f69cc1b39879b99dc67fb554.avif?t=1787021468\" width=348 height=116 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After surviving a brutal storm at sea, Simon Rhodes awakens on a mysterious island ruled by a sprawling hedge maze and its terrifying inhabitants. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blast your way through relentless enemies, conserve your limited bullets, and survive as long as you can in this retro-inspired top-down arcade challenge. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose between <i>Normal Play</i> for a gradual challenge or <i>Difficult Play</i> for instant chaos. Achieve your highest score across both modes! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features </strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Evade, shoot, or outmaneuver monsters in a top-down hedge maze. </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From invisible ghosts to relentless werewolves, each foe behaves uniquely. </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three grenades – A last-resort panic button to clear the screen when overwhelmed. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Four maze layouts to choose from.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two difficulty modes: </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Normal Play</i> – Easier start, progressive difficulty ramp.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Difficult Play</i> – Instant chaos. All enemies are  aggressive from the start. </p></li></ul></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Separate high score tables for each mode. </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by 2nd generation “Stalker/Cavern” games of the early 1980s. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no maps, no allies, and no way to fight forever. How long can you last before the hedge consumes you? </p>",
